    "domain":"api.lab.test","record_type":"A","value":"172.30.0.22"
    "domain":"api.lab.test","record_type":"A","value":"172.30.0.23"
    "domain":"www.lab.test","record_type":"CNAME","value":"api.lab.test"
api.lab.test 최종 응답: 172.30.0.23 172.30.0.21 172.30.0.22 
